Al
\end{legend}

\begin{legend}
Fe
\end{legend}

\begin{legend}
Cu
\end{legend}

\begin{caption}
Fig. 2. EDS line scanning analysis of AlCrFeCoNiCu alloy.
\end{caption}

\begin{legend}
