|:-------------------------|:--------|:------------------|:--------------------------------|:------------------------------------------------------|
| Sample                   | [mm] -  | [mm] 20           | [mm] ~15                        | Aluminum alloy powder AlSi7Mg0.6                      |
|                          |         |                   |                                 | and alumina                                           |
| Punch/piston Die         | 10 20.6 | 20 40             | 35 48                           | Graphite R7710 Graphite R7710                         |
| Stepper (conical)        | 10      | 33.8 (Small side) | 45                              | Graphite R7710                                        |
